        <mxCell id="posture-flow" value="1. Complete questionnaire&#xa;2. AI analyzes responses&#xa;3. Generates personalized report&#xa;&#128227; Grade (A–F) per category&#xa;&#128227; Top 5 vulnerabilities&#xa;&#128227; Prioritized recommendations" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
