        <mxCell id="why-items" value="&#128281; Unique content every time&#xa;   No repeated questions&#xa;&#127758; Personalized experiences&#xa;   Adapts to user responses&#xa;&#128200; Scalable education&#xa;   Infinite scenario generation&#xa;&#128273; Security focus&#xa;   Topic-bounded AI prevents&#xa;   off-topic misuse" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
